// Deterministic PubGrub SemVer 2.0 Dependency Constraint Solver, Conflict Derivation
// Tree Builder, Monotonic Feature Unifier, and Side-by-Side Major-Version Isolation
// Engine (`compiler/pkg/resolver/mod.ax`, T855 / E20.2).
//
// Implements SPEC-111 §§1..3 & §5 (`AXS-PKG-001`..`005`, `AXS-PKG-010`..`013`,
// `AXS-PKG-020`..`024`, `AXS-PKG-050`..`053`; `REQ-ECO-8736`, `REQ-PKG-022`,
// `REQ-PKG-024`, `REQ-PKG-025`, `INV-PKG-001`).

